<title>USA: Calif. officials propose PacTel merger terms.</title>
<headline>Calif. officials propose PacTel merger terms.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two members of the California Public Utilities Commission proposed on Monday that the state regulatory panel approve Pacific Telesis Group's merger with SBC Communications Inc on condition that a Pacific Telesis unit refund $248 million to ratepayers.</p>
<p>The proposed refund is less than half the $590.5 million that two administrative law judges last month recommended should be paid by Pacific Telesis unit Pacific Bell.</p>
</text>
